      html: '<h1>Welcome to BrewDocs</h1>\n<p><strong>BrewDocs</strong> is the unofficial documentation wiki for TizenBrew and all of its\nmods. Whether you are setting up TizenBrew for the first time, looking to install\na new mod, or trying to fix a problem, you will find everything you need here.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>What Is TizenBrew?</h2>\n<p>TizenBrew is a free, open-source platform for Samsung Smart TVs that lets you\ninstall powerful mods — like an ad-free version of YouTube — directly on your TV.\nYou only need a PC to set it up once, and after that everything runs on the TV.</p>\n<p>If you are new here, the best place to start is the\n<a href="#tb-install" class="int-link">TizenBrew Installation</a> guide.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Quick Links</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align="left">I want to…</th>\n<th align="left">Go to…</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align="left">Install TizenBrew for the first time</td>\n<td align="left"><a href="#tb-install" class="int-link">Installation</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">Get ad-free YouTube on my Samsung TV</td>\n<td align="left"><a href="#tt-overview" class="int-link">TizenTube</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">Add a new mod to TizenBrew</td>\n<td align="left"><a href="#tb-modules" class="int-link">Module System</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">Fix something that is not working</td>\n<td align="left"><a href="#troubleshooting" class="int-link">Troubleshooting</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">Browse all topics</td>\n<td align="left"><a href="#home" class="int-link">Table of Contents</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2>Installing BrewDocs as a TizenBrew Module</h2>\n<p>BrewDocs is itself a TizenBrew module — so you can read this very wiki directly\non your Samsung TV without ever touching a phone or PC.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open TizenBrew on your Samsung TV.</li>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Module Manager</strong> (the 3rd icon from the left at the top of\nthe TizenBrew home screen).</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Add Module</strong>.</li>\n<li>Enter <code>axelnanol/brewdocs</code> and confirm.</li>\n<li>BrewDocs will appear in your TizenBrew dashboard.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Use the colour buttons and directional pad on your remote to navigate between pages.</p>\n<p>For general module installation guidance, see\n<a href="#tb-modules" class="int-link">TizenBrew Module System</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Remote Controls</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align="left">Button</th>\n<th align="left">Action</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align="left">⬆⬇ D-pad</td>\n<td align="left">Scroll sidebar / navigate content</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">⬅➡ D-pad</td>\n<td align="left">Switch between sidebar and content panels</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">Chan ▲</td>\n<td align="left">Page up in content</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">Chan ▼</td>\n<td align="left">Page down in content</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">🔴 Red</td>\n<td align="left">Previous page</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">🟢 Green</td>\n<td align="left">Next page</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">🟡 Yellow</td>\n<td align="left">Home / overview page</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">🔵 Blue</td>\n<td align="left">Scroll content back to top</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align="left">⏎ Back</td>\n<td align="left">Go back in history / exit to TizenBrew</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2>Reading BrewDocs in a Browser</h2>\n<p>The same content is hosted on GitHub Pages and is always up to date:\n<a href="https://axelnanol.github.io/brewdocs/dist/brewdocs.html" class="ext-link">https://axelnanol.github.io/brewdocs/dist/brewdocs.html</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>About BrewDocs</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align="left">Source</th>\n<th align="left">Author</th>\n<th align="left">Module type</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align="left"><a href="https://github.com/axelnanol/brewdocs" class="ext-link">axelnanol/brewdocs</a></td>\n<td align="left"><a href="https://github.com/axelnanol" class="ext-link">Axel Nanol</a></td>\n<td align="left"><code>app</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>',
