      html: '<h1>BrewDocs — Table of Contents</h1>\n<p>Use the table of contents below to find the topic you are looking for.\nYou can also use the sidebar on the left to jump directly to any page.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>TizenBrew</h2>\n<p>TizenBrew is the modular platform that makes all of these mods possible.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="#tb-overview" class="int-link">Overview</a> — What TizenBrew is and how it works</li>\n<li><a href="#tb-install" class="int-link">Installation</a> — Installing TizenBrew on your Samsung TV</li>\n<li><a href="#tb-modules" class="int-link">Module System</a> — Installing modules and writing your own</li>\n<li><a href="#tb-building" class="int-link">Building &amp; Resigning</a> — Rebuilding and resigning the app package</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>TizenBrew Mods</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="#tt-overview" class="int-link">TizenTube</a> — Ad-free, sponsor-free YouTube for Samsung TVs</li>\n<li><a href="#tp-overview" class="int-link">TizenPortal</a> — Universal browser shell for Tizen OS<ul>\n<li><a href="#tp-usage" class="int-link">Usage Guide</a> — Day-to-day usage and remote-control reference</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href="#tbrowse-overview" class="int-link">TizenBrowse</a> — Ad-free browsing mod for Samsung TVs</li>\n<li><a href="#tflix-overview" class="int-link">TFlix</a> — Netflix-like mod for Cineby.gd on Samsung TVs</li>\n<li><a href="#ht-overview" class="int-link">HyperTizen</a> — Hyperion / HyperHDR Ambilight capturer for Tizen TVs (Tizen 6.5+)</li>\n<li><a href="#twitchtb-overview" class="int-link">TwitchTB</a> — Ad-free Twitch mod with 7TV emotes for Samsung TVs</li>\n<li><a href="#pvtb-overview" class="int-link">PrimeVideoTB</a> — Ad-blocking and enhanced Amazon Prime Video for Samsung TVs</li>\n<li><a href="#agtb-overview" class="int-link">ArtGalleryTB</a> — Multi-museum art slideshow for Samsung TVs</li>\n<li><a href="#bb-overview" class="int-link">BrewBridge</a> — Real-time JSON data-transfer bridge for TizenBrew</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Media &amp; Apps</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="#jf-overview" class="int-link">Jellyfin on Tizen</a> — Free open-source media server (TizenBrew module + standalone installers)</li>\n<li><a href="#ml-overview" class="int-link">Moonlight on Tizen</a> — NVIDIA GameStream / Sunshine client (Chrome/WASM for Tizen 5.5+, NaCl for older TVs)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Related &amp; Other Projects</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="#ttcobalt-overview" class="int-link">TizenTube Cobalt</a> — TizenTube for Android / Google TV (not a TizenBrew module)</li>\n<li><a href="#other-overview" class="int-link">Tizen Community Packages &amp; Other Projects</a> — community bundles, independent ports, failed projects</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>BrewDocs</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="#brewdocs-overview" class="int-link">BrewDocs</a> — Installing BrewDocs itself as a TizenBrew module</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Support</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="#faq" class="int-link">FAQ</a> — Frequently asked questions</li>\n<li><a href="#troubleshooting" class="int-link">Troubleshooting</a> — Step-by-step fixes for common errors</li>\n</ul>',
